{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03242","headline":"寒食江州满塘驿 · 宋之问","name":"寒食江州满塘驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年上巳洛桥边，今年寒食庐山曲。\n遥怜巩树花应满，复见吴洲草新绿。\n吴洲春草兰杜芳，感物思归怀故乡。\n驿骑明朝宿何处？猿声今夜断君肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"汪 俊"}